<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0C0E11 0%, #1B2026 65%, #0C0E11 100%);padding:72px 24px;">
  <div class="hero-grid" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:2px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#A9D3C9;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">Our Services</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Subdivision Adelaide: Land Division and Subdivision Surveys</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Splitting a block in Adelaide is a planning, survey and titles process, not just a survey. Find out what it involves, then talk to an independent Licensed Surveyor.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+61855503814" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (08) 5550 3814</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a Written Quote</a>
